      "cooked": "<p>Hello for all…<br>\nSo I want to change the email login for a user but I don’t have permission to do that despite that I am login as administrator, I also try to give my self permission from role permission manager but also with not avail.<br>\nSo anyone know how we can change the email without need to access the database using terminal.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/7/17f0609dc2bc5ee90440c4d0675e6e42b8c084f0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/17f0609dc2bc5ee90440c4d0675e6e42b8c084f0\" title=\"changing email login\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17f0609dc2bc5ee90440c4d0675e6e42b8c084f0_2_690x297.png\" alt=\"changing email login\" data-base62-sha1=\"3pLZg1Df6doOCBAzpcpMn2ofpRK\" width=\"690\" height=\"297\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17f0609dc2bc5ee90440c4d0675e6e42b8c084f0_2_690x297.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17f0609dc2bc5ee90440c4d0675e6e42b8c084f0_2_1035x445.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/7/17f0609dc2bc5ee90440c4d0675e6e42b8c084f0.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"ECF2F1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">changing email login</span><span class=\"informations\">1324×571 44.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
