      "created_at": "2024-10-08T17:42:41.172Z",
      "cooked": "<p>many thanks and respect <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/heart.png?v=12\" title=\":heart:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":heart:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ncp\">@NCP</a><br>\nSince you are here do you have any update for this topic:</p><aside class=\"quote\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"134312\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/76d3ee/48.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/object-has-no-attribute-error-in-attendance-server-error/134312\">Object has no attribute error in Attendance (server error)</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/hr/22\"><span data-category-id=\"22\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #ffd478; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF;\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category \"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">Frappe HR</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    I get this error when I click on attendance in HR \nAttributeError: ‘NoneType’ object has no attribute ‘nodes_’ \nPossible source of error: hrms (app) \nanyone encounter such error before…?\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>\nI think I have now more than two week without any solution, I am about to became crazy from this message…</p>",
